  "preservation_findings": {
    "4Q115": "Partial court wording at 4:5–6, not whole 4:3–6. Spirit formula, chief-magicians title and request supplied; row 4 has unidentified traces, no secure 4:7 opening; row 16 including Nebuchadnezzar is wholly supplied. Sixteen displayed rows are not sixteen intact lines.",
    "4Q112": "Only tiny 4:29–30 remnants at fragment 8 rows 17–18; no independent court introduction. Nebuchadnezzar is supplied.",
    "4Q242": "King נבני, severe affliction, seven years, בתימן, Jewish diviner, and declare/write survive. Exile affiliation, full Most High title, bronze/iron and speech bridge are supplied. No preserved Daniel name, madness or animal behavior. Gaps and dotted letters retained in source assets."
  },
  "root_assessment": [
    "Different literary forms merit parallel comparison, not an automatic eclectic source.",
    "Shared motifs or a material list do not uniquely identify a donor or direction; supplied material cannot be independent support.",
